      <Desc>THE ORGANIZATION IS FOCUSED ON THE RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN CONTINUING EDUCATION AND ECONOMIC MOBILITY. IT BELIEVES THERE IS NO HIGHER PURPOSE THAN THE PURSUIT OF EDUCATION AND THAT THIS PURSUIT SHOULD BE ACCESSIBLE TO EVERY PERSON REGARDLESS OF THE CHALLENGES THEY MAY FACE. THE ORGANIZATION WORKS TO UNDERSTAND, MEASURE, AND ACTIVELY IMPROVE TANGIBLE OUTCOMES BEYOND COMPLETION OF A PROGRAM OR DEGREE SO THAT EVERYONE CAN SHARE MORE EQUITABLY IN THAT SUCCESS. THE ORGANIZATION PROVIDES SCHOLARSHIP AND EDUCATIONAL LOAN PROGRAMS AND COUNSELING ON FINANCIAL AND DEBT FORGIVENESS.</Desc>
